[Music]  welcome back to las vegas now have you  ever wondered  what being part of a clinical trial is  all about excel clinical research tells  us more take a look  [Music]  a clinical trial is a research study  that is conducted by excel clinical  research  and we are investigating  a drug or medication for fda approval  so why would someone come in to enroll  into a clinical trial  one common reason is that it's an  alternative  treatment not available not yet  available  or not yet approved by the fda so  for example if you had liver cancer  there is a pharmaceutical company that's  developed a medication that could cure  your liver cancer but it's not fda  approved yet  it goes through a clinical trial to  assess the  safety of the medication and efficacy  of the drug so that would be an  alternative treatment available to to  you  to see if that will benefit your medical  condition  xcel clinical research does studies on  the flu virus the coronavirus as well as  various studies on eczema eczema is a  skin disorder found on a lot of  people especially people of color  it's a it's almost a rash that you find  on the skin  it's itchy it's red it includes  dryness and sometimes open wounds  we are looking for patients that have  moderate to severe  eczema that qualify and at least 10  percent of their body  usually our patients don't experience  very many side effects  with the eczema study we have seen a  side effect of  a headache but that can be relieved with  tylenol  so for um in order to be eligible for  the coronavirus study you do have to  have  coronavirus you could either be having  symptoms or you  could be present with no symptoms um the  length of that study  is approximately 169 days with as little  as  four visits here on site another study  that we do have going on here at excel  is the vaccine  study for coronavirus as well it's more  of a preventative  study so we don't want you to have  coronavirus we're also doing a study  with  influenza or flu as well because  not only do we have coronavirus but  we're also having flu season that is  here as well  so we do want to be able to give  patients treatment options for the flu  when you enroll into a clinical trial  you do receive  a patient stipend or compensation  for your time and participation and  travel you do not need to have a  referral from your physician  we do accept referrals from your  physician but  you are welcome to call excel clinical  research  and we will explain to you all the  criteria  required in order to make sure you're  healthy enough to enroll into a clinical  trial  excel clinical research is located on  south maryland parkway you can find them  online  at vegasstudy.com or call them at  702-553-1236  las vegas now we'll be right back

